  "readme_structural_dictionary_lines": [
    "The dataset combines individual-level plant fecundity measurements, transect-level bee and plant community data, and plot-level environmental variables.",
    "Variables - id_plot: Unique identifier for each individual plant. - species: Plant species code, as used consistently throughout the associated manuscript. - site: Remnant vegetation site where the plant is located. - crop_type: Crop adjacent to the remnant (canola or wheat). - transect: Position of the transect within the remnant (edge or core). - treat: Pollination treatment applied to the plant. Levels include: - OP: Open pollination - OPSupp: Open pollination with supplemental pollen - Bag: ",
    "This file contains transect-level data on bee abundance and plant and bee diversity.",
    "Each row represents a single transect.",
    "Variables - site: Remnant vegetation site. - crop: Crop adjacent to the remnant (canola or wheat). - transect: Transect position within the remnant (edge or core). - area: Area of the remnant (km²). - honeybee: Total number of honeybees recorded per transect. - nativebee: Total number of native bees recorded per transect. - all_bees: Total bee abundance per transect (honeybees + native bees)."
  ],
  "effect_outcomes_opened": false,
  "numeric_effects_calculated": false,
  "next_gate": "freeze one fragmentation estimand and common independent-unit frame from structural fields before inspecting bee/seed response values"
}
